{"id":"vod_sn_35852","vodId":"35852","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"妖怪旅馆营业中","name_cn":"妖怪旅馆营业中","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0a5d904e5a302437bd88848f51f8add1.jpg"},"summary":"津场木葵（东山奈央 配音）表面看来只是一个平凡的大学二年级女生，实际上从祖父那里继承了能够看见妖怪的力量。祖父过世之后，葵忽然在某一天被召唤到了名为“天神屋”旅馆之中，这座旅馆坐落在妖魔鬼怪聚集的隐世之中。　　原来，葵的祖父在生前签下了巨额债务，无奈之下只能用葵来还债，答应将葵嫁给天神屋的大老板（小西克幸 配音），然而，葵无论如何都不愿意违背自己的心意，于是，她决定留在天神屋，靠打工还债。完美主义者银次（土岐隼一 配音）、性格冲动粗鲁，但却每一天都在认真努力的晓（内田雄马 配音）、外表冷漠但内心火热的雪女（加隈亚衣 配音），和这些妖怪们在一起，葵的日常拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uKnRNGaneV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qwHMWpSq7f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tf7NRiAvuH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JDNzKt1XGX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pTCADePVct1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vNqWKwiefZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mBBh9YD1yY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dUwWX0hS5L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R3AX7iPDmm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dsNDCPe10R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZuiTkAR7Tg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NwPreuMzk51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3LrJ8QiLtT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yCgUL0ZgXu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1